          "tag": "h3",
          "heading": "GDPR \u2014 EU Data Protection",
          "body": "Protects the personal data of anyone in the EU or EEA \u2014 names, emails, even location data. If we handle data for EU crew, customers, or partners, GDPR applies, no matter where we're based. Any breach must be reported within 72 hours."
        },
        {
          "tag": "h3",
          "heading": "DPDPA \u2014 India's Data Law",
          "body": "India's own data protection law, built on the same idea: protect anyone's personal data, wherever we hold it. It covers any of our systems with Indian crew, customer, or staff data \u2014 and breaches follow that same fast reporting timeline."
        }
